---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="OptimListing Privacy Policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bricolage font-bold text-foreground mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-sm text-muted-foreground max-w-none space-y-6">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use OptimListing, we collect the following information:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Your name, email address, and password (hashed).</li>
        <li><strong>Listing data:</strong> Product titles, descriptions, tags, and images you submit for optimization.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Number of optimizations performed, pages visited, and feature usage.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> Processed securely by Dodo Payments. We do not store your credit card details.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide AI-powered listing optimization services.</li>
        <li>Send transactional emails (welcome, password reset, billing).</li>
        <li>Improve our AI models and service quality.</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Data Storage and Security</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is stored on secure servers using industry-standard encryption. Passwords are hashed using bcrypt. We use JWT-based authentication for session management. Payment processing is handled by Dodo Payments, a PCI-compliant payment processor.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Dodo Payments:</strong> Payment processing. <a href="https://dodopayments.com/privacy" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>Resend:</strong> Transactional email delivery. <a href="https://resend.com/privacy" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>OpenAI / DeepSeek:</strong> AI optimization processing. Listing data is sent to these services for text generation only and is not stored by them for training.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your account and all associated data.</li>
        <li>Export your optimized listing history.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:support@optimlisting.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">privacy@optimlisting.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  strong {
    color: var(--text-muted-foreground);
  }
  h2, a {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
</style>
